  "scope": "For the ordinary 4 by 4 transversal achievement game exactly as frozen in source.md and formalized in problem.md, the minimax forced-win time is T_4=11. In particular, the exported positional O policy prevents X from completing a transversal through ply 9 against every legal X branch, while the recorded source strategy gives T_4 at most 11.",
